uage or fix translations, create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project or join directly through ",[216,232,236],{"href":233,"rel":234},"https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002Fjoin\u002Fproject\u002Fhszo85uo3K",[235],"nofollow","FiveNet's POEditor project",[238,239,241],"h3",{"id":240},"how-to-add-a-new-language","How to add a new language",[243,244,245,248,273,285,288],"ol",{},[206,246,247],{},"Create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project to discuss the language you want to add.",[206,249,250,251],{},"Include the following details in the issue:\n",[203,252,253,261,267],{},[206,254,255,256,260],{},"Language name (for example ",[257,258,259],"code",{},"French",")",[206,262,263,264,260],{},"Language code (for example ",[257,265,266],{},"fr",[206,268,269,270,260],{},"Language icon (for example ",[257,271,272],{},"i-flagpack-fr",[206,274,275,276],{},"After approval, the language will be added to POEditor.\n",[203,277,278],{},[206,279,280,281,220],{},"Then create a POEditor account and join through ",[216,282,284],{"href":233,"rel":283},[235],"the project link",[206,286,287],{},"You can then start translating the strings in the POEditor project.",[206,289,290,291],{},"Developers sync translations from POEditor to FiveNet regularly.\n",[203,292,293,296],{},[206,294,295],{},"After sync and release, the language becomes available in the app.",[206,297,298],{},"If you run into issues, create a GitHub issue or ask in the FiveNet Discord server.",[222,300],{},[302,303,307,315],"card",{"target":304,"title":305,"to":306},"_blank","FiveNet uses POEditor for translations","https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002F",[187,308,309,310,314],{},"Thanks to ",[216,311,313],{"href":306,"rel":312},[235],"POEditor"," for providing FiveNet with a free translation project!",[187,316,317],{},[193,318],{"alt":319,"src":320,":width":321,":zoom":322,"align":323},"POEditor Logo","\u002Fimages\u002Fpoeditor-logo.svg","150","false","center",{"title":325,"searchDepth":326,"depth":326,"links":327},"",2,[328,